My power company has scheduled us for an all-day power outage
tomorrow.  -_-

I'll try to keep the outage to a minimum (i.e. to have the servers
on unless the power is *actually* out), but in particular I have to
leave the house around 7am Pacific, so I'll have to turn everything
off before I leave, and it'll stay off for at least 2 or
3 hours.

